    "title": "Maximum White Tiles Covered by a Carpet",
    "category": "Sliding Window",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given intervals representing white tiles on a number line and the length of a carpet, determine the maximum number of white tiles that can be covered by placing the carpet optimally.",
